  'b54a278a9f86c2c81b50629775866475691da0aacc1b6e345980e3bfec851341' => 'Tá an seiceán SELECT de do SQL <emDid Déantar</em> go ceart go mór. IE - <code>SELECT devices.id AS `devices.id`, devices.name AS `devices.name` ...</code>.<br> <br>Tá an seiceán WHERE de do SQL <emDid Déantar</em> go ceart go mór go mór. <code>WHERE @filter</code> ionas faic Open-AudIT conas a cheart do cheisteanna a cheimseach. Faidf an cheisteanna seo a bheith árach, ach is féidir leat an rogha Admin a bheith agat. <br> <br>Is bealaíocht ceisteanna SQL a léiriú ar feiceann sin atá go có nua <code>os_group</code> a ainmnamh "Linux" - <br><code>SELECT devices.id AS `devices.id`, devices.icon AS `devices.icon`, devices.type AS `devices.type`, devices.name AS `devices.name`, devices.os_name AS `devices.os_name` FROM devices WHERE @filter AND devices.os_group = "Linux"</code><br> <br></p>',
