  'cec9f78389c9c9f4243502d8b8d8b3944f6fce3d2d59fbe0222ff2f881e5da98' => 'Starting June 2018 Google has implemented a pay-as-you-go pricing model for the Google Maps Platform APIs. Previously, most users with moderate usage could use Google Maps, which are embedded into opCharts and Open-AudIT Professional/Enterprise, for free. Googles new policy is outlined here,',
